{
    "name": "M5Stack Tab5",
    "chip": "ESP32-P4",
    "description": "M5Stack Tab5 (ESP32-P4, 16 MB flash, 32 MB PSRAM), first version: 5\" 720 x 1280 display built in (ILI9881C, MIPI-DSI), GT911 touch on I2C (SDA 31, SCL 32, 0x14, interrupt G23); the ADC and PWM settings are those of the ESP32-S3, not checked against the P4",
    "platform": "esp32",
    "pins": 55,
    "uarts": 5,
